<view class="container"><view class="section-title">隐私与设置</view><view class="muted mt16">掌上智康坚持隐私优先，尽量在本地完成AI分析。</view><view class="card settings mt24"><view class="setting"><view><text>云端数据同步</text><text class="muted">关闭后训练数据仅保存在本机</text></view><switch checked="{{cloud}}" color="#1A237E" bindchange="toggleCloud"/></view><view class="setting"><view><text>训练视频保存</text><text class="muted">默认关闭，不保存原始训练视频</text></view><switch checked="{{video}}" color="#1A237E" bindchange="toggleVideo"/></view><view class="setting"><view><text>AI实时语音</text><text class="muted">训练过程中播报动作纠正</text></view><switch checked="{{voice}}" color="#1A237E" bindchange="toggleVoice"/></view></view><view class="danger card mt24" bindtap="clearData"><text>一键清除训练数据</text><text class="muted">删除本机训练历史</text></view></view>